64
00:02:42,044 --> 00:02:43,346
Start at the record someone wants

65
00:02:43,366 --> 00:02:46,400
explained. Inspect fusion and display

66
00:02:46,420 --> 00:02:50,150
rules, then scoring and reranking, then

67
00:02:50,170 --> 00:02:51,386
matched evidence.

68
00:02:51,549 --> 00:02:53,565
Continue to the candidate source,

69
00:02:53,585 --> 00:02:56,554
