70
00:02:56,716 --> 00:02:58,745
Each step answers a different question

71
00:02:58,765 --> 00:03:00,381
about how the record arrived.

72
00:03:00,934 --> 00:03:03,744
This is inspection order, not the system’s

73
00:03:03,764 --> 00:03:04,981
execution order.

74
00:03:05,156 --> 00:03:08,409
A snippet, label, deduplication rule or

75
00:03:08,429 --> 00:03:10,729
diversification step may alter what is

76
00:03:10,749 --> 00:03:13,190
seen. A product that exposes a matched

77
00:03:13,210 --> 00:03:15,626
