79
00:03:18,468 --> 00:03:20,729
Keep going until the evidence stops, and

80
00:03:20,749 --> 00:03:22,068
mark that boundary.

81
00:03:22,971 --> 00:03:25,470
Boolean conditions can show eligibility

82
00:03:25,542 --> 00:03:27,339
