88
00:03:40,539 --> 00:03:42,714
Dense inspection can expose the indexed

89
00:03:42,734 --> 00:03:46,580
unit, encoder, similarity, candidate rank

90
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,371
and approximate search settings.

91
00:03:48,546 --> 00:03:51,078
It does not automatically supply a simple

92
00:03:51,098 --> 00:03:53,539
human readable causal story about a latent

93
00:03:53,559 --> 00:03:56,516
feature. A highlighted word, citation

94
00:03:56,536 --> 00:03:59,222
count or attractive snippet is not proof

95
00:03:59,242 --> 00:04:01,193
that it caused the final position.

96
00:04:02,110 --> 00:04:05,259
Sparse expansion terms and weights, or

97
00:04:05,279 --> 00:04:08,184
late interaction token alignments, expose

98
00:04:08,204 --> 00:04:10,942
useful layers. They do not establish that

99
00:04:10,962 --> 00:04:14,061
those visible pieces describe the whole

100
00:04:14,081 --> 00:04:15,168
model decision.

101
00:04:15,344 --> 00:04:18,184
Inspect candidate lists, fusion rules,

102
00:04:18,217 --> 00:04:20,813
reranking, cutoffs and presentation as

103
00:04:20,833 --> 00:04:21,483
well.

104
00:04:22,033 --> 00:04:25,106
For agentic control, inspect each chosen

105
00:04:25,126 --> 00:04:28,843
tool, query, source, observation, next

106
00:04:28,863 --> 00:04:30,595
action and stopping point.

107
00:04:30,757 --> 00:04:32,618
The model’s account of its reasoning does

108
00:04:32,638 --> 00:04:35,749
not establish what caused those choices.

109
00:04:35,925 --> 00:04:38,495
A helpful narrative should be labelled as

110
00:04:38,515 --> 00:04:41,265
interpretation when it is not derived from

111
00:04:41,285 --> 00:04:43,288
recorded execution evidence.

112
00:04:44,188 --> 00:04:46,731
The goal is an actionable audit trail and

113
00:04:46,751 --> 00:04:49,540
an accurate mental model, not disclosure

114
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,473
of every engineering detail.

115
00:04:51,635 --> 00:04:53,677
Distinguish what you observed, what the

116
00:04:53,697 --> 00:04:56,975
vendor documents and what remains unknown.

117
00:04:57,138 --> 00:04:59,309
Do not replace missing evidence with an

118
00:04:59,329 --> 00:05:02,452
explanation that merely sounds plausible.

119
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,543
A reproducible search can remain poorly

120
00:05:05,563 --> 00:05:08,005
understood, and a clear explanation can

121
00:05:08,025 --> 00:05:10,775
remain impossible to rerun without saved

122
00:05:10,795 --> 00:05:13,777
inputs, versions and outputs.

123
00:05:13,939 --> 00:05:16,806
Documentation and inspection need separate

124
00:05:16,826 --> 00:05:19,602
questions. The final film turns those

125
00:05:19,622 --> 00:05:22,553
